### Happy-path сценарий: register -> login -> me -> refresh -> me с новым access.
### Запускать запросы по порядку. access/refresh-токены автоматически переиспользуются (VS Code REST Client).

@host = http://localhost:8080
@email = flow-{{$timestamp}}@example.com
@username = flow_{{$timestamp}}
@password = flow-pass-12345


### 1. Register — 201 Created
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### 2. Login — 200 OK, забираем accessToken и refreshToken
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### 3. Me с access — 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}


### 4. Refresh — 200 OK, ротация: новый accessToken + новый refreshToken
# @name refresh
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}


### 5. Me с новым access — 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{refresh.response.body.accessToken}}


### 6. Refresh старым (уже rotate'нутым) — 401 AUTH-008
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}
